==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lancer (Enemy)|Lancer]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**9 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**6 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As this stage features only Dark enemies with the exception of Lancer, it is highly advised to bring Anti-Dark units such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]]. Take note that stalling isn't a good strategy because of the Gory Darks.

